{"_v":1,"id":"the-enormous-crocodile-west-end-2026","cat":"off-west-end","cs":81.58,"rc":7,"bd":{"positive":6,"mixed":1,"negative":0},"rv":[{"cn":"Andrzej Lukowski","o":"Time Out London","s":60,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://www.timeout.com/london/theatre/the-enormous-crocodile-review","d":"2024-05-23","q":"A cute and peppy kids' show with great puppets, but even at his gentlest, Dahl without the dark streak doesn't feel quite right."},{"cn":"Christiana Rose","o":"BroadwayWorld","s":100,"b":"Rave","t":2,"u":"https://www.broadwayworld.com/westend/article/Review-THE-ENORMOUS-CROCODILE-Regents-Park-Open-Air-Theatre-20250820","d":"2025-08-20","q":"This is a production which combines dazzling puppetry, witty lyrics, exuberant music and inspired staging into a family show which feels both faithful to Dahl and brimming with theatrical magic."},{"cn":"Mary Pollard","o":"Everything Theatre","s":94,"b":"Rave","t":2,"u":"https://everything-theatre.co.uk/2024/05/review-the-enormous-crocodile-regents-park-open-air-theatre/","d":"2024-05-27","q":"Fabulously funny, with snappy songs, perfect puppetry and a sensational cast"},{"cn":"Anya Ryan","o":"London Theatre","s":87,"b":"Rave","t":2,"u":"https://www.londontheatre.co.uk/reviews/the-enormous-crocodile-review-regents-park-open-air-theatre","d":"2025-08-21","q":"Definitely a snappy performance that sends the kids away grinning from ear to ear."},{"cn":"Ron Simpson","o":"WhatsOnStage","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://www.whatsonstage.com/news/roald-dahls-the-enormous-crocodile-at-leeds-playhouse-review_1557063/","d":"2023-12-08"},{"cn":"Raphael Kohn","o":"All That Dazzles  (UK)","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":3,"u":"https://www.allthatdazzles.co.uk/post/review-the-enormous-crocodile-the-musical-regent-s-park-open-air-theatre","d":"2024-05-23","q":"It’s filled with wee, fart and bottom jokes."},{"cn":"Chris Abbott","o":"West End Best Friend","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":3,"u":"https://www.westendbestfriend.co.uk/news/review-the-enormous-crocodile-regents-park-open-air-theatre#:~:text=Emily%20Lim%27s%20production%20delivers%20all,on%20the%20press%20show%20audience.","d":"2024-05-23","q":"A very successful 55-minute version of this classic picture book, which was rapturously received"}],"au":{"score":85.95,"designation":"Liking","sources":{"lb":{"s":98,"c":7,"sr":4.9},"mz":{"s":74,"c":21,"sr":3.7},"ss":{"s":96,"c":11},"sp":{"s":100,"c":4,"sr":5}}},"cn":{"t":"This colorful, energetic musical adaptation of Roald Dahl's tale charms with its inventive design and infectious songs, though some critics feel it lacks menace. A joyful, bite-sized introduction to theatre for young children.","rc":7},"hi":"/images/shows/the-enormous-crocodile-west-end-2026/hero.webp","pd":"2026-07-28","ca":[{"n":"Chelsea Da Silva","r":"The Enormous Crocodile"},{"n":"Precious Abimbola","r":"Trunky the Elephant"},{"n":"Jordan Eskeisa","r":"Humpy Rumpy the Hippopotamus"},{"n":"Ciara Hudson","r":"Roly Poly Bird"},{"n":"Marienella Phillips","r":"Muggle Wump the Monkey"}]}